WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.400
What?

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.030
That's...!

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.910
Captain brought out an Avatar!

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.040
Shindou!

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:24.580
What's going on? Even Shindou's got one?

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:27.000
This is the first time it's happened.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:31.620
Even Raimon's Captain Shindou has unleashed his Avatar!

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:37.140
The realization of an Avatar through mutual resonance!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:42.350
Lancelot has awakened Shindou-kun's hidden abilities deep in his heart!

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:45.960
Interesting.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:27.580
The one to protect Raimon...

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:31.000
Is me!!

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:35.790
Captain!

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:36.340
Move.

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:37.420
But...

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:39.170
Move!

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:47.710
I'm the captain!

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:49.810
I have to protect soccer!

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.290
Captain...

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:52.810
Can you do it?

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:56.320
I'll tear you down!

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:13.340
What a block!

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:15.600
It's a clash of Avatars!

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:19.880
It's risen high!

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:21.420
Whose ball will it be?

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:27.700
That's enough!

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:30.550
Why?

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:32.020
The match ends here.

00:03:32.570 --> 00:03:33.520
What?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:35.360
We're withdrawing.

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:36.690
Are you running away?

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:38.850
Running away?

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:40.860
More like we're letting <i>you</i>  get away.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:43.810
But to look at it another way,

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:48.620
you could say your existence has protected Raimon, Shindou-kun.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:55.840
The Black Knights are leaving the match incomplete!

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:58.890
Captain!

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.090
Shindou!

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.470
This is bad.

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:03.800
This is getting really bad!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:05.240
Captain...

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:15.910
Tenma.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.960
Aoi, you came!

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:20.500
Yeah.

00:04:20.500 --> 00:04:21.860
I was really shocked.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:24.150
Are you okay?

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:25.490
I'm fine.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:29.600
Looks like a lot has happened before the induction ceremony.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.580
What is it?

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:37.090
Oh yeah! We haven't had the induction ceremony yet!

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:44.800
Things might get lively this year.

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:47.140
Wouldn't you say so, Akane?

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:51.270
I got lots of pics of Shin-sama!

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:54.480
That's all you think about.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:05:00.170
Report from Kuroki of the Black Knights.

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.940
They've spotted a user at Raimon Jr. High.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:12.890
Congratulations on entering junior high school.

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:18.540
I'm sure all of you are aware that our school has a high reputation for its soccer.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:22.610
And I'm sure you've heard about the many accomplishments...

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:28.270
...from the Inazuma Eleven team to all of the teams at Raimon that have proceeded.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:30.570
That match earlier was sure something!

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:33.690
You faced them head on even though you're a first-year!

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:34.850
You were watching?

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:35.740
Yeah!

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:37.830
And I already remember your name.

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:40.900
Matsukaze Tenma, right?

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:42.840
You're pretty cool, Tenma!

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:44.740
Thanks.

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.280
What's your name?

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:49.910
I'm Nishizono Shinsuke.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.450
We'll be in the same class. Good to meet you!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:52.870
Nice to meet you.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:57.170
That's the first time I've seen an Avatar.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:06:00.270
So they really exist! Do you have one, Tenma?

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:01.630
No way.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:04.390
But you're joining the soccer club, right?

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:05.300
Yeah.

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:09.050
Me too! I've decided to join the soccer club.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:12.070
Really? Then let's go to the club room together afterwards.

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:12.850
Okay!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.640
Let's do our best to get into the first team!

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:18.300
I'm pretty good, you know!

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:24.900
I'm sorry about that.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:35.290
Kirino?

00:06:35.290 --> 00:06:36.500
You okay?

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:38.490
What happened?

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:40.360
You don't remember?

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:43.390
I remember him grabbing me around here...

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:44.710
But after that...

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:49.260
<i>Don't give up on soccer.</i>

00:06:50.190 --> 00:06:52.370
You brought out an Avatar.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:53.510
I did?

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:57.720
That's the first time I've seen you make such a scary face.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:00.640
You must've really had it in for that Tsurugi guy.

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:03.860
Where are the others?

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:05.820
They're cleaning up the old club room.

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.200
It got destroyed, remember?

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:09.810
Don't push yourself!

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:11.090
You still need rest.

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:12.360
I'm the <i>captain!</i>

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:19.450
You take on way too much responsibility.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:21.690
Get everyone together.

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:22.420
Immediately!

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:24.940
Tenma!

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:27.120
You're done for today, right?

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:27.500
Let's go home!

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:30.610
We're going to the soccer club right now.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.640
I'm kind of worried.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:36.150
All that stuff happened to it this morning.

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:38.470
Huh? If you said "we", then you too?

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:41.660
Um... Nishizono-kun, was it?

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:42.510
Yeah!

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:44.910
Um, sorry, what was your name again?

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:47.080
I don't remember everyone yet.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.040
We just met today.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.570
I don't remember everyone's names yet either.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:53.310
Just call this one Aoi.

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:55.160
What do you mean "this one"?

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:59.140
I'm Sorano Aoi. I went to the same elementary school as Tenma.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.380
Then I'll see you later, Aoi.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.500
We're on a tight schedule.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.420
Wait, I'm coming too!

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:13.030
So you really are a Seed from Fifth Sector?

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:17.660
And under the Holy Emperor's will, you're here to keep an eye on us here at Raimon.

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:18.990
Yeah.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:24.440
Was the plan to take over the soccer club altered because of that Avatar?

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:27.920
It just means they have a use for them still.

00:08:27.920 --> 00:08:30.540
About Coach Kudou...

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:34.210
Did the Black Knights come for his removal?

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:39.160
My top priority mission is the observation of Avatar users and Kudou's removal.

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.480
Kudou, huh?

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:46.580
We've been trying to find a way to deal with that man as well.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.590
This place is huge.

00:09:03.820 --> 00:09:05.250
You're...

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:06.770
They're in the middle of some drama right now.

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:09.570
What happened?

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:12.160
If you want to join the club, you should quit while you're ahead.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:14.400
The soccer club's over now.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.620
What do you mean?!

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.420
Just take our word for it and leave.

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:20.620
What rude guys.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:28.200
I'm not gonna keep playing soccer when Fifth Sector has their eyes on us!

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.910
That first-year Tsurugi is pretty darn scary too.

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:34.420
We've put up with a lot already, but this is the limit!

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.650
The atmosphere here is terrible...

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.930
It must be about what happened this morning.

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:42.440
Let's go already.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:45.270
Hold up! Wait, wait!

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:46.230
You guys serious?

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.380
Hey!

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:50.150
We're serious, Senpai.

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:52.520
Are you just gonna let them, Shindou?!

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:53.910
There's nothing I can do.

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.490
But there <i>has</i>  to be something!

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:58.180
The second team's over.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:01.410
Ichino, Aoyama, we're going too.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:03.990
Even you guys?

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:04.870
Us too.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:07.110
Hey now, you guys too?

00:10:07.110 --> 00:10:11.300
You finally made it from the second team to the first, and now you're quitting?

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:14.010
We're afraid of Fifth Sector.

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:16.890
It'd look good on my student record if I stayed...

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.550
But I'm not personally into soccer that much.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:21.800
How can you just say that?!

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:23.430
Stop it, Kurumada!

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:27.250
But Sangoku!

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:29.810
We'll all supposed to be facing the same issue here!

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:33.440
Mizumori, Kosaka.

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.110
Thanks for all you've done for us.

00:10:39.730 --> 00:10:41.780
Hopeless, it's all hopeless...

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:46.730
Wait a moment!

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:47.610
Wait!

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:51.440
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.300
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:59.030 --> 00:11:01.690
Please, don't quit!

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:03.890
Sorry, we already have our minds set.

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.610
But...

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:11.580
I was really looking forward to playing soccer with all the upperclassmen at Raimon once I joined.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:14.370
Raimon's soccer club is my inspiration!

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:15.840
You're such a kid.

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:18.850
Didn't you see what happened today?

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:21.690
That's all there is to Raimon's soccer club.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:23.050
That's not true!

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:26.450
See here now, we've gotten scared of soccer now.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:28.140
Scared?

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:30.550
What's so scary about soccer?

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:32.740
I think soccer's a lot of fun.

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:36.720
If we don't all think soccer's fun, then that leaves me feeling sorry for soccer!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.180
Hey, first-year.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:42.400
Feeling <i>sorry</i>  for soccer?

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:44.370
It's not like soccer's a living being.

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:47.930
But that's what I really think!

00:11:48.150 --> 00:11:51.340
If you think it's fun, then I'm sure soccer would be happy too!

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.020
Let them go.

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:55.400
Captain...

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:57.380
Thanks, Shindou.

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:01.230
I was about to snap at the junk this guy says.

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:06.390
Captain, I'm sorry!

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:10.450
Over, it's over...

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:11.660
Aoyama?

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.960
Are you able to keep this up?

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:21.210
Ichino.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:24.070
The second team is over.

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:25.340
I'll be quitting too.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:28.840
All right.

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:36.830
Ichino, it's out of our hands.

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:39.230
I didn't want to leave it "out of our hands"...

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.030
But that's how it is.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:44.350
Hey, you guys.

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:46.110
You're so uncool.

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:47.910
Wouldn't you call that deserting the battlefield?

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:51.170
Mind your own business.

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:53.340
Coach...

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:55.280
What's going on?

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:57.070
We just came across Mizumori-kun too.

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:59.340
Sorry, we can't play anymore.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:00.840
But...!

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.120
Ichino-kun, Aoyama-kun!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:09.020
Let's go.

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:12.190
Are you really okay with this, Coach?

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.060
You're the only ones left?

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:21.650
Yes, nine in the first team.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:23.280
This is everyone.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:24.250
I see.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:26.200
It was all I could do.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:30.350
It's like rats abandoning a sinking ship, eh?

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:33.050
Then doesn't that make us something other than rats?

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:35.080
That makes us members of the soccer club.

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:40.360
I know you've all got complaints about the situation.

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:43.320
So I won't hold it against you if you want to quit.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.390
You're staying? Didn't think you would.

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:47.580
What about yourself?

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:49.440
I figured I might as well.

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:52.400
Isn't it because it'll look good on your student record?

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:57.220
Minamisawa, that doesn't make soccer any fun.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:14:00.180
And are <i>you</i>  having fun with the soccer nowadays, Amagi?

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:05.420
I'm not really playing soccer because I think it's fun or such.

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:09.110
If you do well in it, then you've got an easy life waiting for you after graduating, that's all.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:10.790
Don't you think the same, Amagi?

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:11.740
Well...

00:14:12.340 --> 00:14:13.860
Matsukaze Tenma, right?

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:15.000
Yes!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.380
Thanks for this morning.

00:14:16.380 --> 00:14:20.380
I know you did a lot for us, but this is the Raimon soccer club now.

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:22.230
I'm still fine with it.

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:24.380
I'd still like to join the soccer club!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:27.200
I'd like to join too! Please!

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:30.290
You're a first-year too?

00:14:30.520 --> 00:14:32.760
Yes! My name's Nishizono Shinsuke!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.470
Who would've thought there'd be people to jump on a sinking ship?

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:40.130
I think they just don't know what they're getting into.

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.400
Don't come here anymore.

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:46.160
Don't say that.

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:49.880
Tenma-kun, this morning was just an exception.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.790
You still have to go through the real entrance exam!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.390
I thought I was already in.

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:57.660
A test right off the bat?

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.150
Then let's do it now!

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:00.050
Wait!

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:04.630
Coach Kudou, with what's happened today, what should we do?

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:06.430
True...

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:08.590
How about you come here tomorrow after school?

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:11.760
Yes, sir...

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:15.890
So you finished your dramatic first day as a jr. high school student.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:17.680
Yeah.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.140
Hey, cheer up.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.310
We've got the exam tomorrow.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.470
Speaking of that, I'm joining the club too!

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:27.160
Which one?

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:29.250
Follow the conversation, would you?

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:30.660
The soccer club!

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:32.590
I'll be a manager!

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:33.820
Don't you think I'd be fit for it?

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:36.990
I think it's a good idea!

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:40.590
But I wonder about something.

00:15:40.590 --> 00:15:43.000
Do you think managers get tested, too?

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:47.800
Wouldn't you?

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:50.470
Then what's the test to be a manager like?

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:57.940
I live over there, so...

00:15:57.940 --> 00:15:59.240
Yeah, I'll see you tomorrow.

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:00.020
See you!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.030
Bye!

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:03.730
And this is my place.

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:07.020
You live <i>here</i> ?!

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:11.850
I don't know whether to call it old or just shabby...

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.990
"Shabby" might be over the line.

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:16.250
I'm back!

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:17.870
Welcome back, Tenma.

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:19.660
Your mom?!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:20.910
She's so young!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.950
No! Aki-nee is one of my relatives!

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:26.800
And she's the landlord of this Kogarashi Manor!

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:29.540
I'm so sorry I called it shabby!

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:33.160
I don't mind.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.620
Is he a friend of yours, Tenma?

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:37.810
Yeah, this is Nishizono. He's in my class.

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:39.470
Nice to meet you, Nishizono-kun.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.410
Yes, ma'am!

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:42.310
Oh, I baked some cookies.

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:43.400
Sweet!

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:45.170
Shinsuke, you should have some too.

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:47.530
Aki-nee's cookies are really great!

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:48.640
Can I?

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:50.020
Sure thing, Nishizono-kun.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:52.330
Thank you!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.720
My parents are in Okinawa for work reasons.

00:16:57.720 --> 00:17:00.760
It's just me renting one of the rooms in Aki-nee's apartment.

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:02.830
Then you live by yourself?

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:03.630
Yep.

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.830
Isn't it really tough being by yourself?

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:07.510
Not really.

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:08.460
It's working out somehow.

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:15.320
Oh, you have a dog!

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:16.630
His name's Sasuke.

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:19.970
He really likes it when you scratch him behind his ears.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:21.500
Let's see...

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.040
See? He's so cute.

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:35.520
What's that?

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:37.950
Oh, that.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:39.900
That's my lifesaver.

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:44.540
When I was really little, I was living in Okinawa too.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:48.350
One day when we were coming back from the ocean, I heard a puppy crying.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.730
He was stuck between some boards and couldn't get out.

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:56.020
I tried to save him when I got caught in the mess myself.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:26.380
Wow! So that's why it's your lifesaver.

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:28.600
Then that puppy back then...

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:29.620
Yep.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:30.820
Right, Sasuke?

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:35.500
And look, doesn't this look exactly like Raimon's mark?

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.950
Now that you mention it...

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:43.150
That's when I started wanting to play soccer at Raimon.

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:47.120
Yes?

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:50.400
You must be hungry.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.880
Go ahead!

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:53.360
Thanks for the food!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:59.050
How was the induction ceremony?

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.070
Were you nervous?

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.430
I was!

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:04.090
But a lot of awesome things happened this morning!

00:19:04.090 --> 00:19:06.270
Yeah, it was a real ruckus!

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:12.580
It's an Avatar without a sliver of doubt.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:16.420
The user seems to have no recollection of it.

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:18.520
So he just recently awakened.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:22.180
What shall be done with Raimon Jr. High from here on?

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:27.070
This user still has unknown strength.

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:29.220
This could be usable.

00:19:29.220 --> 00:19:31.940
Yes, as the Holy Emperor wishes.

00:19:49.170 --> 00:19:50.210
I'm back!

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:51.690
Welcome back.

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:53.280
Breakfast is ready.

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:55.470
Make sure you wash your hands before eating!

00:19:55.470 --> 00:19:56.440
Okay!

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:57.130
Oh!

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.960
Did you get any calls from America?

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:02.040
Stop asking that every day!

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:04.800
So there <i>was</i>  a call!{kono egao}

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:06.550
Enough of that!

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.310
Hurry and eat and get ready!

00:20:08.310 --> 00:20:10.070
Focus on your exam today!

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:10.070
{omg sauce-K}

00:20:10.070 --> 00:20:10.810
Okay~!

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.570
I'll do my best.

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:22.990
I'm going to play soccer at Raimon!

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.330
How many do you think will come to join?

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:34.210
We just had all that commotion...

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.750
I can't tell for this year.

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:40.000
Shindou, why did you say that to those guys yesterday?

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:42.470
<i>Don't come here anymore.</i>

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:46.050
Enthusiasm can only get you so far.

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:52.370
Why are we playing soccer?

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:01.530
We've got to do what we can with the nine members left at Raimon's soccer club.

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:06.280
You mean ten members.

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:12.110
Chairman!

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.410
Tsurugi-kun is joining the soccer club.

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:19.130
Good to be on the team...

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:21.210
Captain.

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:54.950
Let's go, Shinsuke!

00:22:54.950 --> 00:22:56.350
It's the entrance exam!

00:22:56.350 --> 00:23:00.100
We'll make it through and get into the club no matter what!

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:04.390
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Tenma's Entrance Exam!

00:23:04.390 --> 00:23:06.180
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.180 --> 00:23:17.730
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:26.090
If you think it's fun, then I'm sure soccer would be happy too!

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:26.950
That's all!
